ográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_58":128},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_35":130,"_42":52,"_37":131,"_46":132,"_55":-7,"_11":133,"_56":134},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_58":135},"platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx",{"_35":137,"_42":52,"_37":138,"_46":139,"_55":-7,"_11":140,"_56":141},"es:platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx","Perfiles de certificado","Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles",{"_58":142},"platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx",{"_35":144,"_42":52,"_37":145,"_46":146,"_55":-7,"_11":147,"_56":148},"es:platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx","Jerarquía y rotación","Diseña autoridades raíz e intermedias y sustituye certificados o claves sin romper la confianza.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation",{"_58":149},"platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx",{"_35":151,"_42":52,"_37":152,"_46":153,"_55":-7,"_11":154,"_56":155},"es:platform/pki/certificates.mdx","Certificados","Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/certificates",{"_58":156},"platform/pki/certificates.mdx",{"_35":158,"_42":79,"_55":-7,"_37":159},"es:_3","Validación",{"_35":161,"_42":52,"_37":162,"_46":163,"_55":-7,"_11":164,"_56":165},"es:platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx","Validación de certificados","Comprueba cadena, identidad, usos y revocación desde el consumidor.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-51/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation",{"_58":166},"platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx",{"_35":168,"_42":52,"_37":169,"_46":170,"_55":-7,"_11":171,"_56":172},"es:platform/